WEBVTT

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:17.080
"Doushisha University VS Hainokikan University"

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.870
"Doushisha University VS Hainokikan University"
Are you serious?

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:21.700
Did you really make this app yourself, Yuu?

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.450
I-It wasn't that hard!

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:26.370
No way that's true.

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:30.290
I mean... You can automatically
pull up league results on it.

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:33.580
You can pull up the profiles
of the opponents, too!

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:37.250
Yuu. Maybe you should quit being
a manager and start up a company--

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:38.910
N-No way!

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:43.120
Please stop! We can't live
without Yuu anymore!

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:49.790
I heard the team roster for our opponents
tomorrow, Hainokikan, hasn't changed much.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:52.250
Right! We crushed them last time.

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:54.620
We'll probably be fine this year, too.

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:55.290
The problem is...

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:56.660
"Doushisha University VS Hainokikan University"
"Koufuuin University"
The problem is...

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.370
Because of Koufuuin, Doushisha has
always been second in the Kansai League.

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:07.250
And, they say that Hongou-<i>senpai</i>'s team
has really polished up this year.

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:11.120
Oh, wasn't Natsusa-<i>san</i>'s senior
in Maisagi High School?

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:14.290
"Madoka Hongou" "Kazutaka Hongou"
The God of Backs, Madoka Hongou.

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:19.290
"Madoka Hongou" "Kazutaka Hongou"
The Forward God of Destruction,
Kazutaka Hongou. They were famous siblings.

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:22.290
Yeah, they were dependable
teammates in high school...

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:26.250
But now they are fourth- and
third-year students at Koufuuin...

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:28.120
They're strong...

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:35.870
Well, let's focus on our match
tomorrow against Hainoki first!

00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:37.750
Y-Yes!

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:42.410
Natsusa-<i>san</i>, are you really not
coming to the match tomorrow?

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:45.950
Yeah. Sorry, I have something
to do this weekend.

00:01:45.950 --> 00:01:49.790
But we'll be fine as long
as you're there, Yuu.

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:51.330
Yes!

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:55.580
What are you planning?

00:01:57.580 --> 00:02:03.000
I'm going to drag our own spineless
God of Backs, Ibuki Ueoka, home.

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:35.950
"Rou"
"No. 2 'The Weight of a Wallet
and the Wallet's Owner is Proportional'"

00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:37.040
"No. 2 'The Weight of a Wallet
and the Wallet's Owner is Proportional'"

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:42.250
What? That's amazing!

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:44.000
You have this much muscle?

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:46.700
Huh? What? Let me touch them, too!

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:49.290
You're right! Crazy!

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:51.700
I’m the type that looks
slimmer than I actually am.

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:53.700
Do you do some kind of sport?

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:54.410
Well, just a bit of weight training.

00:03:54.410 --> 00:03:56.830
"Third Year College Student" "Ibuki Ueoka"
"Previously Number 10, Stand-Off"
Well, just a bit of weight training.

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:58.450
"Third Year College Student" "Ibuki Ueoka"
"Previously Number 10, Stand-Off"
I mean, I gotta be prepared when a woman
needs an arm for a pillow, right?

00:03:58.450 --> 00:04:01.750
I mean, I gotta be prepared when a woman
needs an arm for a pillow, right?

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:03.950
I want to try it out!

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:06.200
Me, too...

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:10.870
Huh? Where did this boy come from?!

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:12.120
He's so cute!

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:13.580
A friend of yours, Ibuki?

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:16.450
Good evening. I'm Natsusa Yuzuki.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:18.870
Natsusa... You...

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:21.750
Long time no see, Ibuki-<i>senpai</i>!

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:23.790
You didn't come and visit me even once.

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:27.290
I thought you died! Or maybe died!

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:29.870
Hey, let's drink together!

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:31.040
Let's drink! Let's drink!

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.950
No. Go home. You're under-age.

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:36.620
I'm old enough to drink this year.

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:39.500
How long has time stopped for you?

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:41.870
Why are you here?!

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:44.830
Please come back to rugby.

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:46.410
Right now.

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:49.000
What? Ibuki played rugby?!

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:50.870
That's super amazing!

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:52.450
I quit rugby.

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:53.910
Huh?!

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:00.700
Why? Because of me?

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:03.410
No. It has nothing to do with you.

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:04.750
Go home.

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:06.620
Then, play with us!

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:08.580
Let's go! Let's go!

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:09.410
Ouch!

00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:10.250
Natsusa!

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:11.250
What happened?

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:13.580
--Is he okay?
--Hey, Natsusa! Natsusa?!

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:14.870
I-I'm so sorry!

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:16.700
Are you okay? Should we call for someone?

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:17.910
No, he's fine.

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:19.910
I'm going to take him out for now.

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:21.040
B-But!

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:23.660
What should we do?! Can we help?

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:27.040
There's nothing we can do about it.

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:38.540
Should we go to the hospital?

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:39.830
Your neck hurts, right?

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:41.290
Wait a second.

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:46.000
I deleted the number...

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:47.410
Natsusa, give me your smartphone.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:49.120
I'll call for Seiichirou.

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:51.500
Please don't call him.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:53.290
He has a match tomorrow.

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:55.450
You! What?!

00:05:57.080 --> 00:06:00.410
So, you haven't fallen badly
enough to start smoking.

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:01.580
What the hell?

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:03.500
Seriously, why did you come here?!

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:04.830
To harass me?!

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:07.540
I told you, please come back
to the rugby team.

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:09.200
No, that's impossible!

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:10.620
Is it that?

00:06:10.620 --> 00:06:15.620
"I injured Natsusa so I can't
play rugby anymore!"

00:06:15.620 --> 00:06:17.580
That cliché of cliché?

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:19.790
Stop it.

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:23.790
Just go home. I'll take you.

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:25.120
You moved out of the dorms, right?

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:26.580
Where are you living right now?

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:27.700
No thank you.

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:30.120
I can go back home alone on the train.

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:32.830
But, are you really okay?

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:34.750
It's a cervical hernia.

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:37.290
The fact that I can move
my neck means I'm fine.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:40.540
I can't move a single muscle
when it really hurts.

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:47.870
Oh! Let me say this now. I won't give up.

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:54.290
Why?

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:56.620
I can't do anything for you...

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:03.540
Jeez!

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:15.290
Ibuki-<i>senpai</i>!

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:16.790
Perfect timing!

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:21.330
I forgot my mouthpiece. Please take me
to the field at Isui University!

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:24.410
What? I just got back.

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:27.580
And didn't you say you
didn't like this motorcycle?

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:32.250
I don't. It's a bike you got from
that shitty big brother of yours, right?

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:36.830
That's right. The one you did
a roundhouse kick on.

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:39.620
He's really the worst.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:42.200
Just thinking about him
is starting to piss me off.

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:47.160
But your spinelessness pisses
me off even more, Ibuki-<i>senpai</i>!

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:50.620
Please be aware.

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:53.500
Come on! What are you doing?

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:55.580
We have to hurry before it gets dark!

00:07:55.580 --> 00:08:01.080
Your tyranny is seriously on a level
that should be recorded in history books.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:02.830
Please be careful.

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:29.330
Senpai! Please open the door!

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:32.250
Senpai! I know you're in there!

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:34.790
Senpai!

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:35.950
Hey, open up!

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:39.410
You impregnated my little sister
and now you're staying silent?!

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:41.500
"Ueoka"
You...

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:44.040
"Ueoka"
Huh? Did those words ring a bell?

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:46.080
"Ueoka"
How'd you pass the auto-lock?!

00:08:49.910 --> 00:08:51.250
Can I come in?

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:52.200
No.

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:54.870
I'll start screaming again.

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:57.080
Don't push you luck.

00:08:57.080 --> 00:09:02.410
If I get serious, I can easily
take you down. Got it?

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:05.330
I don't think you have the guts to do that.

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:07.750
Want to try me?

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:10.660
Ouch!

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:12.910
Oh. Sorry. That must have hurt.

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:15.540
I forgot I was wearing brass knuckles.

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:20.660
I-I see. Guess it can't be helped
if it was an accident... Yeah...

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.910
I can easily see through
your actions, Ibuki-<i>senpai</i>.

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:26.200
"Club Sign-up Form"
Here you go.

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:28.370
I brought this for you today.

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:31.410
Please fill it out and
bring it with you on Monday.

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:34.830
Natsusa... Hey, I really...

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.500
Oh! That's right!

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:39.790
There was a lot of mail in your post box!

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:42.790
If you don't pay your electricity bill
properly, they'll turn it off!

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:44.620
See you later. I'll come again.

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:49.750
He even knows the code to my post box?

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:54.830
Oh, of course he does.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:58.290
"We buy motorcycles for a good price!"

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.250
It's impossible.

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:07.950
I can't play rugby again...

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:21.870
"Natsusa Yuzuki"

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:27.120
Oh! Thank goodness!

00:10:27.120 --> 00:10:28.950
I finally got a hold of you!

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:30.290
Natsusa...

00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:31.790
Where are you right now?

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:34.120
I heard that you quit the club!

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:36.500
You moved out of the dorms and
didn't say where you were going!

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:38.870
What happened?!

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:41.290
Huh? Senpai?

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:43.120
Maybe the connection is bad...

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:46.790
Senpai! Hey!

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:51.410
I'm sorry, Natsusa...

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:54.200
Why did I ever use that bike...?

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:57.910
Could it be that you're actually really hurt?

00:10:57.910 --> 00:10:59.910
Is that why you quit the team?

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:04.620
I heard that your injuries shouldn't
have affected you as a player...

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:08.200
I can't do anything for you...

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:10.410
Senpai?

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:13.790
So, I'm going to quit rugby.

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:15.000
Huh?

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:19.080
If I can't play rugby anymore...

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:23.500
...maybe I can understand what you're
going through, even a little bit...

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:25.950
Seriously, what the hell are you talking about?

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:29.330
I'm not asking you to forgive me.

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:31.700
I'll never show my face to you again.

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:32.910
Please wait!

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:35.080
I'm really sorry...

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:36.500
Hey!

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:53.620
It's empty...

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:55.540
Guess it can't be helped.

00:11:58.290 --> 00:12:00.660
"Club Sign-up Form
From Natsusa"

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:07.790
"Club Sign-up Form
From Natsusa"

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:14.580
"Club Sign-up Form
From Natsusa"

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:17.830
"Club Sign-up Form"

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:19.830
"Club Sign-up Form"
No! Seriously! When?!

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:21.950
"Club Sign-up Form"

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:25.750
"Second Year College Student" "Sunao Konoe"
"Number 13, Right Centre"

00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:30.910
"Second Year College Student" "Sunao Konoe"
"Number 13, Right Centre"
Natsu-<i>san</i>, are you really trying
to bring Ibuki-<i>senpai </i>back?

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:32.540
I am!

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:35.330
What the hell? Stop that
disgusting Kansai dialect.

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:37.080
And, did he say he was coming back?

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:39.910
Well, I yelled at his front door yesterday

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:42.830
and punched him with some brass knuckles,
but that didn't seem to work.

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:45.580
Why did you think that
would work in the first place?

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:48.410
Why do you want him back, anyway?

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:54.000
I just think that our team has a higher
chance of winning if he comes back.

00:12:56.620 --> 00:13:01.160
But we've won that last two fixtures
in the Kansai League without Ibuki-<i>senpai</i>.

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:06.370
True, but don't you think it'll be hard
to go against Koufuuin without him?

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:09.750
I want to get first place in the Kansai League.

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:15.000
You know it yourself, Su-<i>san</i>. How smoothly
things went when he was number 10.

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:16.620
Wasn't it nasty?

00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:20.700
Move forward!

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:30.410
Well, that's true...

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:35.620
And, if Ibuki-<i>senpai </i>comes back,
your twisted play style would really shine!

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:37.870
I can't win against you, Natsu-<i>san</i>.

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:41.200
Do people who grow up around
tons of nature become like you?

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:42.910
I don't think that matters.

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:46.830
Even someone like you, who grew up
in such a high-class area of the city,

00:13:46.830 --> 00:13:50.290
could end up with a mouth from the slums.

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:51.290
What a mouth!

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:54.160
"Second Year College Student" "Pongsaklek Yunu"
"Number 16, Reserve"
--What are those two talking about?
--Well, try your best.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:57.830
"Second Year College Student" "Tsuugen Sasaki"
"Number 7, Right Flanker"
Pong, you don't need to learn
any of their Japanese.

00:13:57.830 --> 00:14:01.250
Natsu-<i>san</i>, you're such a smooth talker!

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:03.160
"Yamamoto Central Hospital"

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:08.080
"Natsusa Yuzuki"

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:12.120
Natsu, eat this at the very least.

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:14.410
I don't want to.

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:16.660
You're going to lose a lot of weight.

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:18.160
It's easy for you.

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:19.620
That's fine!

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:22.450
I was putting on muscle to play rugby!

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:25.790
If I can't play rugby, I don't need muscles!

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:32.370
Hey, Sei...

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:35.330
Why was it a bike?

00:14:35.330 --> 00:14:38.870
At the very least, it would have been
cooler if I got hurt playing rugby...

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:43.080
What does that have to do with
the fact that you don't want to eat?

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:45.870
Jeez! I'm not talking about that!

00:14:45.870 --> 00:14:46.790
Forget it!

00:14:46.790 --> 00:14:49.370
You don't understand because
you can still play rugby, Sei!

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:55.250
"Burnable Trash"

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:16.330
Did you fill out the club sign-up form?

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:19.660
You! How did you know I was going to be here?!

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:25.500
So, there was a place like this!

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:27.790
As expected of a Christian school...

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:28.910
Hey!

00:15:28.910 --> 00:15:31.450
This is a message from God!

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:33.000
You're going to get divine punishment...

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:35.790
And you're skipping out
on your classes way too much.

00:15:35.790 --> 00:15:40.790
You're 100% a worthless and shallow
man when you don't play rugby.

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:46.160
That's right! So, don't get involved
with me! I won't play rugby.

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:48.450
I don't think you should go.

00:15:48.450 --> 00:15:50.160
Huh?!

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:52.450
You're too easy.

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:56.870
Let's just fill out the club
sign-up form right now.

00:15:56.870 --> 00:15:58.370
Okay, here we go.

00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:02.290
Your name is Ibuki Ueoka...

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:03.410
Natsusa...

00:16:03.410 --> 00:16:05.500
Your address...

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:08.000
Natsusa, listen to me.

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:13.330
Do you have experience in rugby? Yes...

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:15.700
You've been playing since elementary school
so the number of years would be...

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:18.830
Natsusa!

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:22.540
What are you trying to do?

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:24.790
I told you from the beginning.

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:28.370
I want you to come back to the rugby team.

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:30.080
Why?

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:35.200
Right back at you. Why did you quit?

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:36.660
That’s...

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:39.040
See? I was right, wasn't I?

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:43.790
The "I hurt Natsusa..." cliché, right?

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:45.450
That's right!

00:16:48.500 --> 00:16:53.750
I can't go on playing rugby by myself
after hurting you like that!

00:16:53.750 --> 00:16:56.830
Oh? To begin with...

00:16:56.830 --> 00:17:01.290
Are you trying to make things
even just by quitting rugby?

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:04.540
Do they include "quitter"
as a quality of a shallow man?

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:10.750
You want me to forgive you?

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:19.370
There's a way, you know.

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:25.120
Keep playing rugby for me.

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:30.870
Keep playing rugby until I'm satisfied.
Until I say you can stop.

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:36.750
It's the only way I'll ever forgive you.

00:17:38.330 --> 00:17:41.000
Just...

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:45.540
Just me... Is it okay for me
to continue rugby alone?

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:48.500
I mean, if I play rugby...

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:51.500
...won't you be alone?

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:53.870
I'm not alone!

00:17:53.870 --> 00:17:55.870
Why'd you decide something like that?!

00:17:55.870 --> 00:18:01.250
Even if I can't play, I want to watch
you and Sei play rugby up close!

00:18:01.250 --> 00:18:03.410
I can live with rugby that way!

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:05.290
That's what I decided!

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:19.000
Natsusa! Seiichirou!

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:21.410
Was it interesting?

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:24.950
Yeah! You were so cool! Right, Sei-chan?

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:27.040
--Yeah.
--I see!

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:29.250
Then, you two should try playing.

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:30.830
Huh?!

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:37.660
I joined the rugby world
through my admiration of you.

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:41.830
Just about as much as I love playing rugby!

00:18:41.830 --> 00:18:45.450
I love watching you play rugby!

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:47.040
But...

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:51.160
Even though... Even though you've
got me completely infatuated...!

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:58.540
To toss it away like this! You're terrible!

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:06.040
I got it. Then, I'll...

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:47.500
I'm sure everyone will be surprised
when you come back to the rugby team!

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:52.040
Surprised... To begin with,
I'm not sure if I can join again...

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:55.540
Do you know how I quit the rugby club?

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:57.160
You quit with a single phone call.

00:19:57.160 --> 00:19:59.080
You suddenly stopped coming to practice

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:01.540
and ignored everyone who tried to contact you.

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:04.450
You even ignored me but sent me money.

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:07.450
How narrow-minded can you be?

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:10.910
I apologize for my past actions.

00:20:10.910 --> 00:20:14.160
Well, it's fine! Everyone is nice.

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:16.950
If you get on your knees
and lick everyone's shoes...

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:20.160
I've never heard of anyone
re-joining a club that way!

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:21.870
--Okay!
--Huh?

00:20:21.870 --> 00:20:23.540
I've contacted them!

00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:25.700
Contacted who?

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:29.580
I told the coach and captain that
you're going to greet them tomorrow.

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:30.620
Tomorrow?!

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:31.830
Isn't that a little sudden?!

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:34.410
What about my schedule
and my mental preparation?!

00:20:34.410 --> 00:20:37.660
Is there anything you need
to prioritize before rugby?

00:20:39.450 --> 00:20:42.200
No... There isn't.

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:47.830
Did it hurt?

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:49.700
So much!

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:52.830
But I think eating some grilled
meat would make it better.

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:53.830
My mood.

00:20:53.830 --> 00:20:55.450
Your mood?!

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:58.620
Well, let's head out to Shijou street.

00:20:58.620 --> 00:21:01.580
I'm so tired now. Let's get a taxi.

00:21:01.580 --> 00:21:04.580
You're always so quick to use a taxi.

00:21:04.580 --> 00:21:05.450
Huh?

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:08.750
That's not good. It's like
you're oozing a rich-kid aura.

00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:09.620
That's right!

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:11.540
Let's use your bike to go!

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:16.540
Hang in there! My mental strength!

00:22:49.370 --> 00:22:51.660
Cats? You?

00:22:51.660 --> 00:22:52.910
Yeah, two of them.

00:22:52.910 --> 00:22:54.700
Two?!

00:22:54.700 --> 00:22:57.790
Oh, you're doing it again!

00:23:03.910 --> 00:23:05.660
Oh, I unlocked it.

00:23:05.660 --> 00:23:07.660
What are you doing?!

00:23:07.660 --> 00:23:11.370
I can't believe you're still using your
own birthday as your pin. Too easy.

00:23:11.370 --> 00:23:15.250
I never know what pin number
to use for stuff like this!

00:23:15.250 --> 00:23:19.660
Didn't your last girlfriend find out that
you cheated on her because of your phone?

00:23:19.660 --> 00:23:21.870
She wasn't a girlfriend.
She was a friend with benefits.

00:23:21.870 --> 00:23:23.410
Let me see it for a moment.

00:23:25.950 --> 00:23:28.830
There! I changed your pin for you.

00:23:28.830 --> 00:23:32.200
What? What did you change it to?!

00:23:32.200 --> 00:23:34.700
A number you would never forget!

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:46.910
"I moved into a big house but can't get
it all put away... Things keep piling up."
